      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report the case of a 29-year-old man with a long-standing history of abdominal pain related to an intermittent colocolic intussusception caused by pneumatosis cystoides coli. To our knowledge, only one similar case has been reported in the English-language literature."},
